WEBVTT
X-TIMESTAMP-MAP=LOCAL:00:00:00.000,MPEGTS:0

1
00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:18.140
Le vidiyo ichaza ukuthi ungayilungiselela kanjani ingane nomama noma umnakekeli ngaphambi kokwenza ukuhlolwa kwe-reflex ebomvu kuzo zombili izingane ezisanda kuzalwa kanye nezingane ezindala.

2
00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:29.140
Ingane kufanele ibanjwe ivikelekile kodwa ikhululeke, kungaba ethangeni, phezu kwehlombe, noma, uma usana, ilele ngomhlane.

3
00:00:29.140 --> 00:00:37.120
Kubalulekile ukuthi bazizwe bephephile. Izingane ezincane zingase zingaphumuli futhi zingadinga ukusongwa.

4
00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:44.180
Ukuhlola ngokushesha ngemva kokuphakelwa kungasiza njengoba bezokhululeka futhi balale kancane.

5
00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:49.220
Izingane ezindala zingase zizinze ngokudlala ngethoyizi isikhashana.

6
00:00:49.620 --> 00:00:55.320
Khuluma ngezwi elinobungane futhi uzame ukwehla ufike ezingeni lamehlo abo.

7
00:00:55.320 --> 00:01:00.500
Chaza ukuthi uzokwenzani futhi uthole imvume ngaphambi kokuthi uqale.

8
00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:10.440
Okokuqala, buza umama noma umnakekeli ukuthi kukhona yini okungalungile abakubonile ngeso noma ekuboneni kwengane yabo nokuthi sebeyibonile isikhathi esingakanani inkinga.

9
00:01:10.640 --> 00:01:15.120
Okulandelayo, bheka ubuso namehlo engane. Zibuze imibuzo ethile.

10
00:01:15.680 --> 00:01:24.300
Ingabe ingane ibonakala inobuhlungu kwelinye noma womabili iso? Ingabe amehlo avulekile noma awavale ngokuqinile?

11
00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:31.280
Ingabe kukhona ukuchelela noma ukuphuma emehlweni? Ingabe amehlo alingana? Ingabe amajwabu amehlo avuvukele?

12
00:01:32.080 --> 00:01:38.580
Manje, cabanga ngendlela ingane ebona ngayo. Hambisa ubuso bakho kancane ukusuka kolunye kuya kolunye, ubheke amehlo abo.

13
00:01:39.540 --> 00:01:47.970
Amamatheke athule. Ingabe ingane ilandela ukunyakaza kobuso bakho noma isabela ekumoyizeleni kwakho buthule?

14
00:01:47.970 --> 00:01:53.990
Nalapha, zibuze imibuzo ethile. Ingabe womabili amehlo anyakaza ngokukhululeka futhi ndawonye?

15
00:01:54.430 --> 00:02:01.110
Ingabe amehlo aqondile noma iso elilodwa libheke ngaphakathi noma ngaphandle? Ingabe amehlo ayaxega?

16
00:02:03.300 --> 00:02:12.200
Ungasebenzisa futhi izibani ku-Arclight kanye nokuhlosiwe kwesithombe ukuze uthole ukunakwa nokuhlola ikhwalithi yokubona.

17
00:02:12.320 --> 00:02:20.660
Hambisa uhlangothi oluqondiwe uye ohlangothini, phezulu naphansi. Bheka ukuze ubone ukuthi ingane iyalungisa futhi ilandela ilitshe.

18
00:02:21.960 --> 00:02:26.600
Ingabe bangakwazi ukufinyelela futhi bakhombe ngokunembile lapho okuqondiwe khona?

19
00:02:27.360 --> 00:02:35.060
Ngokuvamile, iso elilodwa kuphela elingakwazi ukubona kahle. Wena noma umama ungakwazi ukuvala iso elilodwa, bese elinye.

20
00:02:35.060 --> 00:02:43.320
Hambisa okuqondiwe bese uqhathanisa indlela ingane eziphatha ngayo lapho isebenzisa womabili amehlo, bese elilodwa ngesikhathi.

21
00:02:43.520 --> 00:02:51.380
Uma ingane ingathandi ukumbozwa kweso elilodwa, lokho kuphakamisa ukuthi iso elingamboziwe aliboni kahle.

22
00:02:51.560 --> 00:03:00.560
Uma ucabanga ukuthi ungabona okuthile okungalungile ngeso langaphandle, bheka eduze usebenzisa i-loupe end ye-Arclight.

23
00:03:00.560 --> 00:03:12.150
Khanyisa izibani bese uye phezulu eduze kuka-6 cm. Kungase kudingeke ukuthi usebenzise umunwe wakho ukuze uvule amajwabu amehlo ngobumnene.

24
00:03:12.890 --> 00:03:24.070
Zibuze imibuzo ethile. Ingabe ingxenye emhlophe yeso pink noma ebomvu? Ingabe umfundi noma i-cornea gray noma imhlophe?

25
00:03:24.070 --> 00:03:35.160
Ingabe umfundi uyindilinga? Uyayibona imizimba yangaphandle? Manje usukulungele ukwenza izivivinyo ze-reflex.
